+          <td><strong>typeSpecification is complete and uses the defined vocabularies</strong><br><span class="exp">typeSpecification carries seriesName, agvKinematic, agvClass, maxLoadMass, localizationTypes and navigationTypes, with values drawn from the spec&#x27;s enumerations.</span></td>
+          <td><span class="sev minor">minor</span></td>
